    <section anchor="supporting-data" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-appendix.a">
      <name slugifiedName="name-supporting-data">Supporting Data</name>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-1">As of October 2010, out of the top twenty IRC networks <xref target="TOP100" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="TOP100"/>
<xref target="MAVERICK" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="MAVERICK"/>, ten support TLS/SSL.  Only one of those networks does not
support TLS/SSL via port 6697 and has no plans to support it.  All
others supported it already or are supporting it since being
contacted by the author.  A more detailed analysis is available but
does not fit within the scope of this document.</t>
    </section>
